<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,414.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,414.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,414 today from 1,417 on March 4, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
